Function body: 5 nops + b-to-self (tight 1-instruction loop after 5
"unused" leading nops). gcc's for(;;) unrolls into 5 nops + b-to-start
(7-insn loop body, different semantics). ee-gcc 2.9 has no `naked`
attribute and no way to express "branch to a label past the function
prologue". Keeping skipped.
